---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import heroImage from '~/assets/images/sctmensa-hero-coast-3000x1500.jpg';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Join Mensa',
  description: 'Learn how to join Mensa and explore testing options through American Mensa.',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden">
    <div class="relative h-[200px] sm:h-[260px] md:h-[320px]">
      <img
        src={heroImage.src}
        alt="Fairfield County coastline"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/25"></div>

      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end justify-center px-6 pb-10 md:pb-14">
        <h1 class="text-white text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-center drop-shadow">
          Join Mensa
        </h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BODY CONTENT -->
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 md:py-14">
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
      Membership in Mensa is open to individuals who score in the top 2% on an accepted intelligence test. There are a
      few different ways to qualify, depending on your situation. Some people already have qualifying test scores from
      prior academic or professional testing, while others choose to take a supervised Mensa-administered test.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
      American Mensa maintains the official list of accepted tests and provides detailed information about both using
      prior test scores and scheduling new testing. The link below outlines all available options and what to expect.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8">
      <a
        href="https://www.us.mensa.org/join/testing/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0f2a44] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#14395f] transition-colors"
      >
        Learn About Mensa Testing Options
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
      If you’d like to learn more about local testing opportunities, availability, or have general questions about
      joining Southern Connecticut Mensa, feel free to reach out directly.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
      Joe Lee — President<br />
      j88lee8@gmail.com
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

